  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img width=\"820\" height=\"1293\" src=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Two women shaking hands with a check.\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Guild of Harwich Artists President Cindy Manteiga (left) presents a check for $2000 to a delighted Abigal Newberry-West, Director of The Children’s Center. The donation was funded by the Guild’s annual holiday miniature ornament sale proceeds. </figcaption></figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"image-sizes\">Sizes: <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">150 × 150</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">190 × 300</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">649 × 1,024</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">175 × 131</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51ad26af0b4cd1f6f141fc9d.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">317 × 500</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/e70a67b433bcb5029bb68c5e024950e0df88fdce51